        "original_id": "6d524d58-0dc0-5021-b43d-54179717760d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Harrison\n- Products: Dark Horse, Living in the Material World, Give Me Love (Give Me Peace on Earth)\n- Companies: Apple Records, Recording Industry Association of America\n\nFacts:\n- George Harrison's album Living in the Material World was certified gold by the Recording Industry Association of America two days after its release.\n- Living in the Material World became George Harrison's second number 1 album in the United States.\n- Living in the Material World produced the international hit \"Give Me Love (Give Me Peace on Earth)\".\n- Dark Horse is the fifth studio album by English musician George Harrison.\n- Dark Horse was released on Apple Records in December 1974.\n- Dark Horse followed George Harrison's album Living in the Material World.",
